        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K568-SAV, Clear Crystal Savannah Knobset with Egg and Dart Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBeautiful and elegant, the Crystal Savannah Knob with Egg and Dart Backplate was designed to stand out. The oblong knob is made out of clear crystal so that it will catch the light in almost any room. There is something vintage-feeling about crystal knobs, especially those with fancy backplates like the Egg and Dart, that makes it a great choice for traditional homes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/egg-and-dart-latchset-brass-accents-d05-k568\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D05-K568-SAV Egg and Dart Collection with Savannah Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Crystal Savannah Knob with Egg and Dart Backplate, Brass Accents D05-K568-SAV",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K568-SAV, Crystal Savannah Knob with Egg and Dart Backplate - Beautiful and elegant, the Crystal Savannah Knob with Egg and Dart Backplate was designed to stand out. The oblong knob is made out of clear crystal so that it will catch the light in almost any room. There is something vintage-feeling about crystal knobs, especially those with fancy backplates like the Egg and Dart, that makes it a great choice for traditional homes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
